                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="ms-sm-3">
                                                            Marginally slow to begin. Raced wide without cover in the early stages. Near the 800 metres had to be eased when attempting a run into a tight gap. When questioned regarding the disappointing performance of the gelding, the rider advised that IMPERIAL EMPEROR (IRE) never travelled well throughout. A post-race veterinary examination revealed the gelding to be lame in the left-hind leg. Trainer Mr. B Seemar was advised that prior to the gelding entering to race again he must provide a veterinary certificate of fitness for IMPERIAL EMPEROR (IRE).
