                    <h3 class="mt-2 mb-1">General race comment</h3>

            Jockey T O&#039;Shea (IMPERIAL EMPEROR (IRE) was reprimanded under the provisions of ERA Rule 69(i) for careless riding, in that passing the 800 metres he attempted to improve into a tight gap and bumped MIXTO (USA)(L Dettori) on the hind-quarter, resulting IMPERIAL EMPEROR (IRE) having to be eased and IL MIRACOLO (USA)(J Velazquez) which was following, having to be checked off the heels of IMPERIAL EMEROR (IRE). <br />
<br />
Jockey Y Kawada (WILSON TESORO (JPN) pled guilty to a charge of careless riding under the provision of ERA Rule 69(i), in that near the 500 metres, he directed his mount inwards when insufficiently clear of IL MIRACOLO (USA)(J Velazquez), who was tightened for room and had to be checked. Y Kawada had his license to ride in race suspended for six (6) days to commence on (Sunday, 06.04.2025 and expire midnight Friday, 11.04.2025). In assessing the penalty, Stewards took into account Y Kawada&#039;s good careless riding record, guilty plea and deemed the interference to be in the low range.
        
        
        
        
